Update the Vendo CLI using the hosted installer

Usage: vendo self-update [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --profile <name>     Use a specific account profile
      --version <version>  Install a specific version
      --debug              Enable verbose request diagnostics
  -h, --help               Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo self-update
  $ vendo self-update --version 0.3.0
